(7096823, 1080654, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and use of monochrome but I don''t see much graininess. I''ve found that you lose much of the grain effect when reducing an image from full size to 800 pixels and so have to really exaggerate the effect you want in order to retain it at the smaller size - but maybe the effect here is what you wanted.</td>', 'Lovely image and use of monochrome but I don''t see much graininess. I''ve found that you lose much of the grain effect when reducing an image from full size to 800 pixels and so have to really exaggerate the effect you want in order to retain it at the smaller size - but maybe the effect here is what you wanted.', '2013-09-02 00:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
