(7096924, 1080790, 113591, '<td valign="top">I wanted to say: "Life is a horse race, and you''re your own jockey."<br/> <br/>But then I read it back to myself and realised that from the other side of the coin it is: Oh. Herman is calling me a horse, is he?" or "Does my lawn look like turf to him" etc. Lawsuit written all over it.<br/> <br/>So I''ll just say that the hand brought a flash to me of a jockey flying towards the post.</td>', 'I wanted to say: "Life is a horse race, and you''re your own jockey." But then I read it back to myself and realised that from the other side of the coin it is: Oh. Herman is calling me a horse, is he?" or "Does my lawn look like turf to him" etc. Lawsuit written all over it. So I''ll just say that the hand brought a flash to me of a jockey flying towards the post.', '2013-09-02 03:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
