(7096961, 1080778, 119419, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> Making my way through this most interesting of challenges, without commenting or voting... but here I stop.  I wish I understood why, just as I wish I understood why the photos in this challenge are so much more interesting than the usual.  And yet here it is not the grain but the composition, making wonderful use of light and just the right amount of perspective(/distortion?) and the scantest of detail to portray this soulful waning of Weim. (Or possibly I am incurable dogperson). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you are an incurable dog person, but don''t stop ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: Making my way through this most interesting of challenges, without commenting or voting... but here I stop.  I wish I understood why, just as I wish I understood why the photos in this challenge are so much more interesting than the usual.  And yet here it is not the grain but the composition, making wonderful use of light and just the right amount of perspective(/distortion?) and the scantest of detail to portray this soulful waning of Weim. (Or possibly I am incurable dogperson).   you are an incurable dog person, but don''t stop ;)', '2013-09-02 06:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
